# Pass-through stub used by build_patc1_mini.patlang: programs compiled by
# the mini native compiler use no custom DSL syntax, so a no-op
# expand_syntax_dsls avoids pulling in regex_dsl.patlang's two huge
# closure-dispatch functions (regex_match_string_at/regex_match_at, ~70K
# instructions each) that otherwise dominate build time, while keeping
# patc1_main.patlang's static call to expand_syntax_dsls resolvable.
make a function called expand_syntax_dsls takes source returns result
  return source
end
